{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 10 — `_product-list-text` private block.

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) blocks/_product-list-text.liquid;
  schema t: strings hardcoded to Horizon's English. Deviations (text-block
  precedents): 'content.featured_products' | t hardcoded ("Featured
  products"); custom-preset Font select trimmed 4 -> 2 options; the
  type_preset `info` key dropped (links to per-preset theme settings Dawn
  lacks). Renders the Phase-1b text snippet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign placeholder = '<h3>Featured products</h3>' %}

{% render 'text', fallback_text: placeholder, block: block %}

